<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/53/eng@/~cl_1> <https://schema.org/text> "This Act may be cited as the Labuan Companies (Amendment) Act 2024. Amendment of section 47"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/53/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/53/eng@/~cl_2> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/53/eng@> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/53/eng@> .
